    {
      "id": "9cda27f57187583a",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Product capability map\n\nThree layers for the options agent. **Knowledge Q&A is landed.** Seller desk v1 (scan / cards / monitor / local follow) lives in `runtime/`, not in this vault.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -140,
