    },
    {
      "id": "5c7567558b8905b8",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Builder and Bot — seller desk v1 in runtime",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 830
    },
    {
      "id": "8a64e85f1609447d",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Already in the vault**\n\nOIC-backed concepts and 27 strategy notes. Query via wiki-query. Not a price feed.",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 110
    },
    {
      "id": "546750fdf7452b92",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "wiki/overview.md",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 140
    },
    {
      "id": "39f6d246e72b3972",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "wiki/meta/Futu strategy coverage.md",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 140
    },
    {
      "id": "860f8e2003507e66",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "wiki/meta/Source roles.md",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 490,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 140
    },
    {
      "id": "3f9c7a0bfee9de3c",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "wiki/strategies/Cash-Secured Put.md",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 140
    },
    {
      "id": "dcd895373703eee0",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Separate data module later**\n\nDo not Apify this layer. CME Institute pages in the vault are education, not this box.",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 110
    },
    {
      "id": "b2711870a1d8f81d",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Seller desk v1 (runtime)**\n\nOpenD watchlist scan + snapshots for two-leg credit verticals. Not Yahoo/Polygon. Not OSM.AI as a feed.",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 160
    },
    {
      "id": "65c130635a62f326",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Not this layer**\n\nCME Institute courses and whitepapers, OIC strategy pages, Cboe Options Institute catalogs.",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 140
    },
    {
      "id": "9d0ba45e398eab11",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Later paid feeds**\n\nPolygon or Tradier live chain; Cboe DataShop / LiveVol only if the product is institutional. CME Market Data only if we list futures options.",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 510,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 160
    },
    {
      "id": "38e17004957459bf",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Hong Kong listings**\n\nNot covered by Cboe or CME. Needs a separate vendor (for example the broker or exchange), not these seven English sites.",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 120
    },
    {
      "id": "25fd330a42cc033b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**UI and bot structure**\n\nCopy interaction, not data. Spec note is not default Q&A evidence.",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 110
    },
    {
      "id": "a5d089cc5a8e4e92",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "wiki/meta/Product patterns.md",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 180
    },
    {
      "id": "1ffa726c1723bf46",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Builder (OptionStrat-shaped)**\n\nNet debit/credit, expiration max profit/loss, break-evens, payoff grid and chart, implied-volatility shock. Numbers from our chain.",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 370,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 180
    },
    {
      "id": "ece8ae87dc00d1cc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Bot + seller desk (learned shapes)**\n\nTrigger / condition / action plus OSM-shaped cards, verdicts, protect/TP marks, local follow. OpenD only. No Option Alpha or osmtrade API.",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 570,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 160
    }
  ],
